    "detailed_description": "<h1>A word from the masters of the genre:</h1><p>&quot;It could very well be deemed the spiritual successor to the games we created at Gas Powered Games&quot;<br><i><strong>- Chris Taylor,</strong> Legendary RTS creator of titles like Total Annihilation and Supreme Commander</i><br><br>&quot;Definitely captured the feel, that's awesome&quot;<br><i><strong>- Bradley Rebh,</strong> Lead designer of Supreme Commander Forged Alliance</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary: Shattered Sun is real-time strategy on a grand scale, introducing never before seen mechanics such as earth-cracking superweapons and dynamic, map altering weather control. Freeze the ocean\u2014and then drive your army over it, right into the heart of your enemy\u2019s base! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This fight for survival and supremacy takes place on the eponymous Sanctuary itself, a visually spectacular Dyson Sphere \u2013 a gargantuan, man-made structure that encircles the entire sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/802ddf2067ac9b2d303829ef344237eb.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary is for classic RTS lovers. Build a base, gather resources, and amass an army to face your enemies. <br> <br>Sanctuary has scale. Command armies of hundreds of units, titanic war machines, and crush forests underfoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Sanctuary has depth. There are tech levels, large unit rosters, a flow economy, game mechanics like drone swarms, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary is not about APM. Focus on grand strategy, not endless clicking. Create construction queues, save your favorite base layouts as templates, and issue orders to units still in production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/079ef0621522078d7d9dc060cfc1cd08.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When conventional weapons aren't enough, deploy superweapons that literally break the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as your enemies' bases plummet into the sun below when you destroy the structural supports of the Dyson Sphere itself, crumbling the ground from under them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/c391d01831ea3eaf7cd86605ed070b52.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seize control of Sanctuary's climate systems to reshape the battlefield. Flash-freeze entire oceans, transforming naval channels into highways for your ground forces. Watch as your enemies' fleets become trapped in ice while your armies advance across the frozen wastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/b55cf952eee11fc9271d897b41df8682.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our Strategic Zoom camera lets you seamlessly transition from admiring individual units to commanding vast armies from one single view. Watch as physically simulated projectiles create unexpected moments of warfare - like missiles striking aircraft in mid-flight instead of their intended targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scale matters: wage war across massive 40km x 40km battlefields with up to 10,000 units under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/04265f863a6173e014a19e641a6d61c9.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2758, and humanity's greatest achievement encircles the sun - Sanctuary, a Dyson Sphere housing over a trillion lives. But this marvel of engineering has become a battlefield, its gleaming cities reduced to rubble, its surfaces scarred by endless war. The dreams of paradise have given way to a brutal struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your allegiance among three distinct factions: the pragmatic EDA, the futuristic Chosen, or the enigmatic Guard. Each brings unique strategies, technologies, and units to the fight for control of humanity's greatest creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bf4fcc29c540eb3df917a82b8c433868.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by cutting-edge technology, Sanctuary: Shattered Sun delivers smooth performance even in the largest battles. Every explosion, every unit, and every tactical decision comes together in a seamless experience that pushes the boundaries of what's possible in strategy gaming. Watch thousands of units clash without your PC slowing to a crawl.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary: Shattered Sun is real-time strategy on a grand scale, introducing never before seen mechanics such as earth-cracking superweapons and dynamic, map altering weather control. Freeze the ocean\u2014and then drive your army over it, right into the heart of your enemy\u2019s base! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This fight for survival and supremacy takes place on the eponymous Sanctuary itself, a visually spectacular Dyson Sphere \u2013 a gargantuan, man-made structure that encircles the entire sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/802ddf2067ac9b2d303829ef344237eb.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6b22daf3ed3151e1281b37f622c6ea4e.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary is for classic RTS lovers. Build a base, gather resources, and amass an army to face your enemies. <br> <br>Sanctuary has scale. Command armies of hundreds of units, titanic war machines, and crush forests underfoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Sanctuary has depth. There are tech levels, large unit rosters, a flow economy, game mechanics like drone swarms, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanctuary is not about APM. Focus on grand strategy, not endless clicking. Create construction queues, save your favorite base layouts as templates, and issue orders to units still in production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/079ef0621522078d7d9dc060cfc1cd08.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e93f17545aeafb2624c77c5d4b76be39.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When conventional weapons aren't enough, deploy superweapons that literally break the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as your enemies' bases plummet into the sun below when you destroy the structural supports of the Dyson Sphere itself, crumbling the ground from under them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/c391d01831ea3eaf7cd86605ed070b52.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ab4df4f6780b9c25ce928b56b5577235.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seize control of Sanctuary's climate systems to reshape the battlefield. Flash-freeze entire oceans, transforming naval channels into highways for your ground forces. Watch as your enemies' fleets become trapped in ice while your armies advance across the frozen wastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/b55cf952eee11fc9271d897b41df8682.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/d5299bfa2f573976837d489a18e7c393.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our Strategic Zoom camera lets you seamlessly transition from admiring individual units to commanding vast armies from one single view. Watch as physically simulated projectiles create unexpected moments of warfare - like missiles striking aircraft in mid-flight instead of their intended targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scale matters: wage war across massive 40km x 40km battlefields with up to 10,000 units under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/04265f863a6173e014a19e641a6d61c9.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/6fec263bfff7088f64f43a03cd2432ff.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2758, and humanity's greatest achievement encircles the sun - Sanctuary, a Dyson Sphere housing over a trillion lives. But this marvel of engineering has become a battlefield, its gleaming cities reduced to rubble, its surfaces scarred by endless war. The dreams of paradise have given way to a brutal struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your allegiance among three distinct factions: the pragmatic EDA, the futuristic Chosen, or the enigmatic Guard. Each brings unique strategies, technologies, and units to the fight for control of humanity's greatest creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bf4fcc29c540eb3df917a82b8c433868.webp?t=1735877329\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.poster.avif?t=1735877329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.webm?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/69a154cdcd30fc6233940201d5ab296f.mp4?t=1735877329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by cutting-edge technology, Sanctuary: Shattered Sun delivers smooth performance even in the largest battles. Every explosion, every unit, and every tactical decision comes together in a seamless experience that pushes the boundaries of what's possible in strategy gaming. Watch thousands of units clash without your PC slowing to a crawl.</p>",
